    </exercise>
    <exercise number="51" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>The difference of $$f$$ and $$\frac{1}{3}$$ is $$\frac{1}{12}.$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$f - 1 3 = 1 12 ; f = 5 12 f - 1 3 = 1 12 ; f = 5 12$$</paragraph>
